{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0269_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "583f55d2d5d2944ae6878aa43da5505ed33de83dc112b89be8b47ee0e0e6b4d8", "ja": "ずっとずっと、この先も", "zh": "一直一直，向着未来", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0269_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "9384bc37476f45453099133a306c6e8ad18aad55528dc2152ce411f26a267c34", "ja": "ツアーの宣伝のため、関東各地で仕事に励む\nアイドル達。空いた時間に名所の製糸場を訪\nれ、歴史ある建物を観光する。自分達の劇場\nもずっと残って欲しい、そのためにも目の前\nの公演を頑張ろう！　と決意を新たに。", "zh": "为了宣传巡演，偶像们在关东各地努力工作。趁着空闲时间参观名胜制丝厂，游览历史悠久的建筑。希望自己的剧场也能一直保留下去，为此也要努力完成眼前的公演！大家重新下定决心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0269_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "de73265e2bc350571ff17fa86de60efff84269ff9a484b626cdc661ca221b05c", "ja": "（ツアーの宣伝のため、各地を巡っている。\nその合間に、有名な製糸場に見学にやってきた）", "zh": "（为了宣传巡演，正在各地奔波。趁着空闲，来参观有名的制丝厂。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0269_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_04_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "3fbb03900cf48b747ef158b40bccab11bfe5db4a27c9afbc8d9c73ab7aef2a85", "ja": "へぇ～！　糸ってこんな風にできるんだ……。\nマユがあんなに綺麗な糸になるなんて、すごーいっ！", "zh": "诶～！原来丝线是这样制成的啊……  \n没想到蚕茧能变成那么漂亮的丝线，真厉害～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0269_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_04_1002_011ami", "source_sha256": "59072569988b706f06dc6945a7d077a5ff30f5dc6f7615ea8704b75bd5acd4e9", "ja": "だよねー。おカイコさまって、最初はキモイかもって\n思ったけど、段々カワイく見えてきたよ。", "zh": "对吧——我一开始也觉得蚕宝宝有点恶心，不过渐渐觉得它们也挺可爱的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0269_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_04_1003_045kar", "source_sha256": "13f46cdebd3bb0a847dd4b32ff0440e20f33827979a95211790d2fbf279c63a1", "ja": "う、うん……虫ってあまり得意じゃないけど……。\nおカイコさまは、そこまでじゃないかな……。", "zh": "嗯、嗯……虽然我不太擅长应付虫子……\n但蚕宝宝，好像也没那么可怕呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0269_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_04_1004_046rio", "source_sha256": "bc25682b7f8d5957d7fecd390163d9b3ba71fa10bf188bb399e0fc2148cf10ab", "ja": "なんだかいじらしいわよね♪\nちょっと{$P$}くんみたいかも。", "zh": "总觉得有点惹人怜爱呢♪\n好像有点像{$P$}呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0269_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_04_1005_p", "source_sha256": "0e6734219cc15e389c1e9e9bd93cfcc184ed3f65e0be308f8bb3690746cfac62", "ja": "えっ、それはどういう……？", "zh": "诶，那是什么意思……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0269_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_04_1006_011ami", "source_sha256": "be1cc859cb2fe8abddd1a4ea690f820d6b4c71269b256c13302df9b69613bf10", "ja": "亜美もおカイコさま飼いたいなぁ。そんで\nみさきちに頼んで、衣装に糸を使ってもらうんだ。", "zh": "真美也想养蚕宝宝呢。然后拜托美咲，让她把蚕丝用在服装上。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0269_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_04_1007_046rio", "source_sha256": "d70e492df731930c9c79ea075e74fa1504c23f56b132785180f5da1367713ccc", "ja": "あら、シルクの衣装なんて素敵じゃない！\nでも、飼うの難しそうだけど……亜美ちゃんできるの？", "zh": "哎呀，真丝服装听起来很棒嘛！\n不过，养蚕好像挺难的……亚美养得来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0269_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_04_1008_011ami", "source_sha256": "6a0699702aa11c072bfe03e8ad30664de3a5cda5671a8c99f10303498fe49fbb", "ja": "まあ、そこは兄ちゃんよろよろ～。", "zh": "哎呀，那方面就拜托哥哥啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0269_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_04_1009_p", "source_sha256": "9c9b4743601472e3fba2f8a9152354882e62dbca640a2a478ba97c27ed1c33de", "ja": "こら！　自分でお世話できないなら飼っちゃダメ。", "zh": "喂！如果自己没办法照顾，就不能养。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0269_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_04_1010_045kar", "source_sha256": "7fd6ecd1cae9e0e9717d4a7af995bb11c00f632715a5ebfe8d97221b14dcc00f", "ja": "それにしても……この施設、すごく広いんですね。\n見応えがあるなぁ……。", "zh": "不过话说回来……这个设施，真是很大啊。\n很值得一看呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0269_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_04_1011_046rio", "source_sha256": "a50e49d9a2446e35286e6d43b9821fc844ca38e5c7aeee0b25a408ef47afebc9", "ja": "うんうん、歴史ある建物って独特の雰囲気があって、\n見てるだけで楽しいわよね～。", "zh": "嗯嗯，有历史的建筑就是有种独特的氛围，光是看着就觉得很开心呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0269_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_04_1012_045kar", "source_sha256": "1fe2b880d330e24eebc961bca0f1f539c4bf7fb0e5454352d9faa034075ece0f", "ja": "そ、そうですね……歴史ある、建物……。\n……。", "zh": "是、是啊……有历史的建筑……。\n……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0269_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_04_1013_014mir", "source_sha256": "621746b247ed8ff3e2c2c383b5f418bb9a1f47d86c09954824646ba5aeb42ce8", "ja": "私達の劇場も、こんな風にずっとずっと残って、\n歴史的な建物になったらいいな～。", "zh": "要是我们的剧场也能像这样一直一直留存下去，成为历史建筑就好了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0269_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_04_1014_045kar", "source_sha256": "49eafaa5bd91235254c1208452cb595c2b5e43f195db67b6c3fa82097a5e6b6d", "ja": "あ……！\nわ、私も今、同じこと考えてたんだ……てへへ♪", "zh": "啊……！\n我、我刚才也在想同样的事……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0269_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_04_1015_046rio", "source_sha256": "cf7974d845d7afdac3c1716bb2b7077b5eeae7dbc5a3fbbbe04fe62a31bf9220", "ja": "ウフフ♪　そのためにも、\nまずはツアーを大成功させなくちゃね。", "zh": "呵呵♪ 为了那个目标，\n首先得让巡演大获成功才行呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0269_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_04_1016_011ami", "source_sha256": "0df23ace0ee38f4fc48f5e6eafc3d6c5876ed1fc0a7da74c8f7ee939a983a7a3", "ja": "その売り上げでおカイコさまを買えば、\n亜美たちの劇場も、歴史的ケンゾーブツに……？", "zh": "用那些销售额买来蚕宝宝的话，亚美她们的剧场也会变成历史建筑……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0269_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_04_1017_p", "source_sha256": "f836871b4600a220eead97e603b92b487bb99a371176e2da18867ed133f7a449", "ja": "いや、別に製糸場を建てるつもりはないから。\n劇場は劇場として、頑張っていこう。", "zh": "不，我又没打算去建个缫丝厂。\n剧场就好好当剧场，继续努力吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0269_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_04_1018_046rio", "source_sha256": "3f2649c6be1cf96c676b6c1ba1ce3a9abbf241a2c3a76054f748ac5ca9baf4bd", "ja": "そうよね！　私たちはアイドルらしく……。\n早く帰って、レッスンしましょうか。", "zh": "是啊！我们要像偶像一样……  \n早点回去练习吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0269_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_04_1019_014mir", "source_sha256": "8746e0f609dd04f5fad56e940ae45c3638d79dc09e6d03034b200f066735bb85", "ja": "あ、おカイコさまの形したチョコが売ってるって！\nみんなのお土産に買っていこーっと。", "zh": "啊，听说有卖蚕宝宝形状的巧克力！\n买来当大家的伴手礼吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0269_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_04_1020_045kar", "source_sha256": "a9d03d87ec226c54addcb8a29f714e17c0a3931a6bc2aeb38c051c2913577ab2", "ja": "う、うぅ……か、カワイイけど、\nちょっと食べにくいな……。", "zh": "呜、呜呜……虽、虽然很可爱，\n但感觉有点难以下口呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0269_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_04_1021_p", "source_sha256": "5ff558e6f705f67c3403828a2e9c024b2919d7d3bdfdaf3d3eda62e270f7cd56", "ja": "（なかなか楽しめたみたいだ。\nこの調子で、テンションを高めていきたいな！）", "zh": "（看来玩得挺开心的。照这个势头，想让气氛继续高涨起来！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
